  "comment": "`as TEXT` (uppercase) → case-insensitive at the parser→factory boundary.\nType.Name lowercases to \"text\". A literal's spelling is not its kind, so\nthe .md extension does NOT become a kind here (kind only from `as text/<kind>`\nor a producing action).",
